## 🧠 Machine Learning Methodology

### 📈 Regression
Used to estimate numerical values such as sales, revenue, or prices.

**Evaluation metrics:**
- MAE — Mean Absolute Error
- RMSE — Root Mean Squared Error
- R² Score — Explained variation

### 🎯 Classification
Used to predict categories for supported classification tasks.

**Evaluation metric:**
- Accuracy — Percentage of correct predictions.

> ⚠️ Model performance depends on data quality, selected features, target choice, and evaluation methodology. Predictions are estimates, not guarantees.

